This PR:
- changes the manual blind default to `.github/research/continuous-optimization/candidates/42ec089167994bbc.json`;
- adds a generic contract requiring the configured default to resolve to a committed active candidate;
- rejects a default whose tuning ID appears in either terminal-candidates records or the research dataset registry terminal list.

No DSP, candidate tuning, holdout partitioning, blind policy, search space, shipping, HIL/PQ, product-certification, or release authority changes.
